Package: xoa-support
Version: 0.1.24
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: eveane <https://github.com/eveane/XCP-ng-toolbox>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), tar, coreutils, bash
Recommends: sosreport, redis-tools
Description: XOA support bundle toolkit (collect, scrub, anonymise, inspect)
 Collects Xen Orchestra Appliance support data (sos plugin or standalone
 shell collector), redacts secrets with a strict verification gate,
 optionally anonymises identifiers, and summarizes bundles for humans
 and machines. GPL-2.0-only. Zero Python runtime dependencies.
Homepage: https://github.com/eveane/XCP-ng-toolbox/tree/main/xoa-support
